Job Description:
For appointment to this grade, a candidate must have:
a Diploma in Gemstone Cutting, Lapidary, Gemology, Mineral Processing or Jewellery Technology from a recognized institution;
knowledge of gemstone identification, grading, and valuation techniques;
ability to operate and maintain lapidary equipment; and
Good hand–eye coordination, attention to detail, and manual dexterity.
Duties and Responsibilities
Duties and responsibilities will include: -
examining rough gemstones and determine the best cutting plan;
marking, sawing, splitting, and pre-forming gemstones for faceting;
cutting and facet gemstones to specified angles and proportions;
polishing gemstones to achieve maximum brilliance and quality;
go to method of application »

